's changed to something super cryptic. Same for transfer limits I think hsbc believes customers should have the power to read their minds. Also now the apps logs off when switching between tabs. Chance that this will prevent any security threat: 0%, chance that this will make me fps to a wrong number because I forgot the number: 100%. Thanks a lot what a great app.\",[1640356407,505000000],34,null,null,[\"110145359067741081050\",\"Thibaut Salvador\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6vwWuxotiHN_-BeBqRWrIq52r-ADCZvtybVn8K4ZtLgS0HBk\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.16.0\",null,[[[\"vaf_never_display_ads_experience\",null,[1]],[\"vaf_never_display_ease_of_use\",null,[1]]]],null,[true,false],null,1],[\"c9e414f5-fe6e-42a1-b7dd-6137d847014b\",[\"Hugo Cheong\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFbhHhZ1T292hkQWhRwhQ9cLKZCrEKFZXYwsbHMnyXJa_EjS9i\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"Really laggy. So many clicks to make one transaction.\",[1640318242,260000000],1,null,null,[\"115182653390521746489\",\"Hugo Cheong\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFbhHhZ1T292hkQWhRwhQ9cLKZCrEKFZXYwsbHMnyXJa_EjS9i\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.16.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"8ffc42d3-26d4-494e-b5fd-8b0db5bacd13\",[\"Kunal Pandav\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMPaikdld07rKluDvdqNDlyud5YwT7wbPxAvo617wolPKLgg\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"Can't scan a hk I'd trying from 2 days\",[1640238838,213000000],0,null,null,[\"103755768667289024683\",\"Kunal Pandav\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMPaikdld07rKluDvdqNDlyud5YwT7wbPxAv